{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ridobu1s","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":64,"top":376,"width":350,"height":210},"text":"Private, multi-service clinics with walk-in queues, two cash desks or a lab. Sell faster operations and reliable financial control.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#123834","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sj654zid","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":454,"top":285,"width":358,"height":75},"text":"Validate premium pricing","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#067D68","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dkf6d4jy","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":454,"top":376,"width":350,"height":210},"text":"Target mix: 300 branches at $300, 150 at $700, and 50 at $1,100 per month. Prices are hypotheses, net of discounts.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#123834","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6lknq503","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":844,"top":285,"width":358,"height":75},"text":"Prove value before scaling","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#067D68","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7mtoza18","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":844,"top":376,"width":350,"height":210},"text":"First 90 days: 10 buyer interviews, 3 paid pilots, then 5 paying branches. Target 30% faster registration and fully reconciled cash.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#123834","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nelwryp0","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":64,"top":615,"width":1085,"height":46},"text":"Ambitious, conditional target. ARR excludes setup fees. No verified paying-customer baseline yet.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#516661","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/eyj0m2","slideIndex":0,"text":"Condensed from the Health AI 24-month planning deck dated 11 October 2026. Target confirmed by founder: $3m annual recurring revenue at month 24, not valuation or cumulative revenue. Pricing and acquisition assumptions are unvalidated. Source: founder customer discovery from three days in one clinic, not a market-wide survey. Subscription mix: 300*300 + 150*700 + 50*1100 = $250,000 MRR. Payroll is deferred; AI does not make clinical decisions."}
