{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/b6pkfahg","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":64,"top":563,"width":1120,"height":85},"text":"Month 6 gate: 15 paying branches, proven value and price acceptance.\nIf missed, delay hiring and reforecast; 250 × $400/month gives $1.2m ARR.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#067D68","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"table","id":"tb/tsjm9czm","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":64,"top":190,"width":1152,"height":354},"name":"","rows":5,"cols":3,"preview":"Period | Active branches / MRR | Execution priority"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/321idq","slideIndex":1,"text":"Month 1 = November 2026, month 24 = October 2028. All figures are targets. Endpoint ARPA: $250, $350, $450, $500 at months 6, 12, 18, 24. Monthly active branches are net of churn. Final-quarter additions: approximately 43 net branches/month plus 4 replacements. Device work requires model, protocol, sample messages, matching and clinical validation before a delivery commitment. Operational acceptance requires access controls, backup recovery, audited payments and clinic approval before replacing the old system."}
