{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/0b5t8o","slideIndex":2,"text":"Original model: 24-month subscription revenue $1,713,950; fixed cost $1,599,000; variable service cost 20% of revenue; peak cumulative cash deficit $436,000; cumulative net cash flow -$227,840. Quarterly monthly fixed-cost assumptions, USD thousands: 18,25,38,52,70,90,110,130. All salaries are included in fixed costs. $700,000 is a proposed funding envelope with contingency, not a promise or a funding commitment. Monthly sales and implementation quotas require validation. Six implementers and five support staff comprise 11 delivery/support staff. Contractors provide early legal, accounting and clinical advice. Fundraising should begin before runway falls below six months."}